<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Digifest - Forgot Password</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Hey <%= name %> 👋🏽</h1>
    <p>
      You requested a password reset link, click
      <a href="<%= link %>" target="_blank">here</a> or copy and paste the link
      below in your browser <br />
      <a href="<%= link %>" target="_blank"><%= link %></a>
    </p>

    <p>Kindly ignore if you did not make this request</p>
    <p>Thank you, Digifest team.</p>
  </body>
</html>
